<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine companies six months results forecasts.</title>
<headline>Philippine companies six months results forecasts.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following forecasts are based on polls of Manila-based stock brokerages of their expectations for first half results of the Philippines' leading listed companies. The actual figures are due in the latter half of July.</p>
<p>This table will be published daily, updated with each new</p>
<p>company poll.</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>ABS-CBN INC</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso million) Average forecast    824</p>
<p>1,803 Year-ago figures 676 1,530 Percentage change + 21.9 + 17.84</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>METROPOLITAN BANK &amp; TRUST CO</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion) Average forecast    2.68</p>
<p>6.63 Year-ago figures 2.034 5.002 Percentage change + 31.76 + 32.54</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>AYALA CORP</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion) Average forecast    3.59</p>
<p>7.03 Year-ago figures 3.45 6.23 Percentage change + 4.06 + 12.84</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>SAN MIGUEL CORP</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion) Average forecast    2.40</p>
<p>6.01 Year-ago figures 2.41 5.26 Percentage change - 0.41 + 14.26</p>
<p>			     --------------</p>
<p>PHILIPPINE LONG DISTANCE TELEPHONE CO</p>
<p>			H1 1997	  Full year 1997</p>
<p>			     (peso billion) Average forecast    3.18</p>
<p>6.41 Year-ago figures 2.91 6.44 Percentage change + 9.28 - 0.47</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
